  "title": "Classic Candied Sweet Potatoes",
  "description": "This classic candied sweet potatoes recipe, made with brown sugar and creamy butter, bakes up into a sweetly simple, old-fashioned holiday favorite.",
  "authors": [
    "MICHELLERENE"
